@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Client-Side Lifecycle and Subscription Management (WebSocketManager)

actor "React Component" as View
participant "WebSocketManager" as Manager
participant "buildSocketUrl()" as UrlResolver
participant "Client (@stomp/stompjs)" as StompClient
participant "Transport (WS / SockJS)" as Transport
participant "STOMP Server" as Server

== 1. Instantiation and Subscription Pre-registration ==

View -> Manager: new WebSocketManager(jwt, { useSockJS, events })
activate Manager

View -> Manager: addSubscription("resource/123", handlerCallback)
Manager -> Manager: subscriptions.push({ topic: "resource/123", handler })
note right Manager
  Subscriptions are queued in memory
  before opening the network connection.
end note

== 2. Connection Negotiation and Establishment ==

View -> Manager: initConnection()
opt activated === true
    Manager --> View: Early return (Already connected)
end

Manager -> UrlResolver: buildSocketUrl()
activate UrlResolver
UrlResolver --> Manager: socketUrl
deactivate UrlResolver
note right of UrlResolver
  Algorithmic resolution of host, port, and protocol.
  See activity diagram:
  "16_Flow_WebSocketManager_Connection_Management"
end note

Manager -> StompClient: new Client({ connectHeaders: { Authorization: "Bearer <jwt>" } })
activate StompClient

Manager -> StompClient: client.activate()
Manager -> Manager: activated = true

StompClient -> Transport: Initiate socket (SockJS or native WebSocket)
activate Transport
Transport -> Server: HTTP Handshake / Upgrade to WebSocket
Server --> Transport: 101 Switching Protocols

StompClient -> Server: STOMP Frame: CONNECT (Authorization: Bearer <jwt>)
Server --> StompClient: STOMP Frame: CONNECTED
deactivate Transport

== 3. Automatic Resubscription (resubscribeAll) and Event Dispatch ==

StompClient -> Manager: onConnect()
Manager -> Manager: resubscribeAll()

loop For each subscription in subscriptions[]
    Manager -> StompClient: subscribe("/topic/" + sub.topic, callback)
    StompClient -> Server: STOMP Frame: SUBSCRIBE /topic/resource/123
end

Manager -> View: events.onConnect?.()

... Real-Time Communication ...

Server -> StompClient: STOMP Frame: MESSAGE (body: JSON)
StompClient -> Manager: Invokes registered callback
Manager -> Manager: JSON.parse(message.body)
Manager -> View: handlerCallback(parsedData)

== 4. Teardown and Disconnection ==

View -> Manager: deactivate()
Manager -> StompClient: client.deactivate()
deactivate StompClient
Manager -> Manager: activated = false
Manager -> Manager: subscriptions = []
deactivate Manager

@enduml
